{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s50-p01",
      "text": "Nature is amazing!",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p02",
      "text": "Take a close look at the world of insects, and you'll discover many unbelievable things.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p03",
      "text": "Consider butterflies.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p04",
      "text": "They have beautiful, colourful wings, and strong, fantastic flying skills.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p05",
      "text": "On summer days, you always see them flying freely over gardens and wild fields.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p06",
      "text": "How a butterfly appears is one of the amazing wonders of nature.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p07",
      "text": "In the beginning, female butterflies lay a small egg on a leaf or stem of a plant.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p08",
      "text": "The egg will become something completely different in a few days.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p09",
      "text": "It first becomes a walking insect called caterpillar.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p10",
      "text": "It then has legs, eyes and a body that looks fat.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p11",
      "text": "But it is still not a butterfly.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p12",
      "text": "Soon, after growing big, the caterpillar produces silk threads to make a cover for itself.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p13",
      "text": "It covers itself in a nice protective blanket to go to sleep.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p14",
      "text": "It ties itself to a leaf or a branch, where it is not easy for birds to find.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p15",
      "text": "This stage is known as the pupa stage.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p16",
      "text": "The pupa stays shut until it finishes the transformation.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p17",
      "text": "After a period of time, the blanket breaks and a wet, weak butterfly appears.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p18",
      "text": "It may look ugly at first, but shortly, the wings fill with blood, and the beautiful, colourful butterfly spreads its wings.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p19",
      "text": "Now this insect can fly to the left and to the right to look for food and a partner.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s50-p20",
      "text": "After a few weeks, this adult butterfly lays her eggs, and the cycle begins all over again.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p20.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s50-p20.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
